# NOT for peer loop default — cursor-agent bills API quota.
# Peer loop uses $0 clipboard + transcript (see notes/AUTOMATION.md).
#
# Only use this file if you explicitly run peer_loop with --paid-api.
# Copy to ~/.config/{{PROJECT_NAME}}/cursor-agent.env — never commit the real file.
#
# Option A: API key from https://cursor.com/dashboard/cloud-agents (costs money)
# CURSOR_API_KEY=cursor_...
#
# Option B: run `cursor-agent login` once in Terminal (may still bill API quota).
